CITY OF CHEYENNE CITY COUNCIL WORK SESSION AGENDA
Unified Development Code (UDC) Annual Review

February 21, 2025, at 12:00 p.m.
Municipal Building – Council Chambers
2101 O’Neil Avenue, Cheyenne, WY 82001

https://us02web.zoom.us/j/85058998562?pwd=9Obl2eEOCm5xEkY0RpFAUME62SccaI.1
Passcode:  WS02212025
Or Dial: 346-248-7799; Webinar ID:  850 5899 8562; Passcode:  4434470326

1.
Introduction and Unified Development Code (UDC) Annual Review
Overview – Charles Bloom
2.
Annual Review comments received – Charles Bloom and Staff
a. Concerns from the public
i. Allowance of metal fences by right (corrugated steel and
similar)
ii. Allowance of off premises window signage with no coverage
restrictions
iii. Creation of recreational vehicle parks and campgrounds
regulations
iv. Allowance of salons as home occupations
v. Require permits and a survey for all new fences
vi. Restrict residential front driveways for lots with alley access
b. Concerns from Staff
i. Landscape code amendments (Council champion, Dr. Rinne)
ii. Continued amendments to the right-size housing regulations
iii. Amendments to make the UDC more user friendly (Lot types,
other items)
```

